#: _speech_core/schemes/catalog.py:209
msgid "When NVDA starts, if Play sounds when starting or exiting NVDA is checked in NVDA's General settings. NVDA plays it before add-ons load, so while this item has a sound, ClassicSpeech turns that option off and plays the start and exit sounds itself."
